# SLSA Life Membership Nomination: Chris Jacobson

> **Purpose:** field-by-field content for the SLSA Honours online (Jotform) Life Membership nomination.
> Copy each block into the matching form field. The form's limits are **word limits, not character limits** (confirmed 2026-07-17). The showcase allows 400 words and each record-of-service answer allows 1000 words. Narrative fields carry two versions, **Version 1** (the original concise draft, written when the limits were believed to be character counts) and **Version 2** (expanded to use the word allowance). Word counts are noted per block. No colons or em dashes appear in any form content. Items in `[square brackets]` are data **you must supply or confirm** before submission, collected in the checklist at the foot of this file.
